---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Vineet Rawat & Associates | Chartered Accountants"
  description="Vineet Rawat & Associates is a firm of Chartered Accountants providing audit, taxation, GST, accounting, and compliance services across India, UAE, Australia, and the UK."
  active="home"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker">Vineet Rawat &amp; Associates</span>
      <h1>Chartered Accountants</h1>
      <p>Providing professional audit, taxation, accounting, and compliance services to businesses in India and across the UAE, Australia, and the United Kingdom.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/services/" class="btn btn-gold">Explore Our Services</a>
        <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn-outline">Read Articles</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-white">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-gold" id="helpBtn">How We May Help You?</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Services</span>
        <h2>What We Do</h2>
        <p>Comprehensive audit, taxation, accounting, and compliance services for businesses in India and abroad.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel" data-carousel>
        <button class="carousel-btn carousel-prev" aria-label="Previous">&#10094;</button>
        <div class="carousel-track">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#128218;</div>
            <h3>Audit &amp; Assurance</h3>
            <p>Statutory audit, internal audit, tax audit, and other assurance engagements conducted with independence and professionalism.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#128176;</div>
            <h3>Income Tax &amp; GST Advisory</h3>
            <p>Advisory, compliance, and litigation support covering income tax and GST matters for individuals and businesses.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#128202;</div>
            <h3>Accounting &amp; Bookkeeping</h3>
            <p>Accurate bookkeeping, financial statement preparation, and management reporting to keep your business compliant and informed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#127970;</div>
            <h3>Incorporation &amp; ROC / MCA Compliance</h3>
            <p>Incorporation of companies, LLPs, and other entities, along with ongoing ROC and MCA compliance filings.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#128220;</div>
            <h3>Registrations &amp; Advisory</h3>
            <p>Assistance with various registrations, licenses, and general business advisory to support smooth operations.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#128640;</div>
            <h3>Startup Support &amp; Due Diligence</h3>
            <p>Guidance for startups including due diligence, business planning, and readiness assessments for investors and partners.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#127974;</div>
            <h3>Funding Assistance</h3>
            <p>Preparation of documents and assessment of eligibility for funding through banks and NBFCs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#127758;</div>
            <h3>India Entry Advisory</h3>
            <p>Guidance for foreign businesses on entering India, including structuring, approvals, and operational setup.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#128184;</div>
            <h3>FDI &amp; FEMA Advisory</h3>
            <p>Foreign Direct Investment structuring and Reserve Bank of India (FEMA) compliance support.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#127991;</div>
            <h3>Trademark Application &amp; Representation</h3>
            <p>Assistance with trademark applications, filings, and representation in intellectual property matters.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">&#9992;</div>
            <h3>NRI Taxation</h3>
            <p>Tax planning and compliance for Non-Resident Indians, including repatriation and DTAA considerations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="carousel-btn carousel-next" aria-label="Next">&#10095;</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Global Reach</span>
        <h2>Serving Clients Across Borders</h2>
        <p>While rooted in India, we support businesses with cross-border accounting and tax obligations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-4">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>India</h3>
          <p>Audit, income tax, GST, compliance, and company incorporation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>UAE</h3>
          <p>VAT, corporate tax, and accounting services.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Australia</h3>
          <p>Accounting, bookkeeping, and payroll support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>United Kingdom</h3>
          <p>Accounting, bookkeeping, and VAT support.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Expertise</span>
        <h2>Industries We Serve</h2>
        <p>Delivering tailored financial, taxation, compliance, and business advisory solutions to meet the evolving needs of businesses across diverse industries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel industry-carousel" data-carousel>
        <button class="carousel-btn carousel-prev" aria-label="Previous">&#10094;</button>
        <div class="carousel-track">
          <div class="industry-square">IT &amp; Technology Consulting</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Software &amp; SaaS</div>
          <div class="industry-square">E-Commerce</div>
          <div class="industry-square">FMCG &amp; Retail</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Export &amp; Import</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Real Estate &amp; Construction</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Pharmaceuticals &amp; Healthcare</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Restaurants &amp; Hospitality</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Manufacturing</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Logistics &amp; Supply Chain</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Banking &amp; Financial Services</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Education &amp; EdTech</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Media &amp; Entertainment</div>
          <div class="industry-square">Startups &amp; Emerging Businesses</div>
          <div class="industry-square">NRI &amp; Individual Taxation</div>
        </div>
        <button class="carousel-btn carousel-next" aria-label="Next">&#10095;</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Knowledge Centre</span>
        <h2>Articles &amp; Insights</h2>
        <p>Regular updates on tax, compliance, and accounting matters for businesses and individuals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Understanding Statutory Audit in India</h3>
          <p>An overview of who needs a statutory audit and what it entails.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;"><a href="/blog/understanding-statutory-audit-india/">Read article &rarr;</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>GST Compliance: Key Deadlines</h3>
          <p>Important GST return filing dates and common mistakes to avoid.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;"><a href="/blog/">Visit Articles &rarr;</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Startup Funding Readiness</h3>
          <p>Documents and eligibility checks needed for bank and NBFC funding.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;"><a href="/blog/">Visit Articles &rarr;</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="modal-overlay" id="helpModal">
    <div class="modal">
      <button class="modal-close" id="helpModalClose" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <h3>How We May Help You?</h3>
      <p>Share your details and requirement, and we will get back to you.</p>
      <form id="helpForm">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="helpName">Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="helpName" name="name" placeholder="Your full name" required />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="helpPhone">Contact No.</label>
          <input type="tel" id="helpPhone" name="phone" placeholder="Your phone number" required />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="helpEmail">Email ID</label>
          <input type="email" id="helpEmail" name="email" placeholder="Your email address" required />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="helpMessage">Description</label>
          <textarea id="helpMessage" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Mention the service you want and how we can help you" required></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold" style="width:100%;">Submit</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
